{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10295060","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10295060","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1029506001:2":{"text":"안녕하세요~ 저는 페이라고 해요. 근처 마을에 사시나요?","source_cn":"你好呀~我叫菲！你是住在这附近的村民吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BB2FC718C691C50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1029506002:2":{"text":"아… 아, 안녕하세요. 저는 테이스라고 해요. 예전엔 바로 앞마을에서 살았는데...","source_cn":"啊……你、你好，我叫泰瑟丝。我以前就住在前面的村落里……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8591B626E7553BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029506003:1":{"text":"어떤... 어쨌든 지금은 잠시 다른 곳에서 머물고 있죠.","source_cn":"因为一些……总之，现在搬去了别的地方暂住。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D2B0DE13912AEB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1029506003":{"text":"어떤... 어쨌든 지금은 잠시 다른 곳에서 머물고 있죠.","source_cn":"因为一些……总之，现在搬去了别的地方暂住。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D2B0DE13912AEB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029506004:1":{"text":"네, 맞아요. 아이 아빠도... 지금 어쩔 수 없이 부모님과 같이 지내고 있어요...","source_cn":"是的，孩子的父亲也……我现在只能和父母一起生活……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72659C944FCCA6EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029506005:1":{"text":"그건 그렇고, 무슨 일이시죠?","source_cn":"不提这些了，你们有什么事吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AD0F6600F092987","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029506008:1":{"text":"우리는 보물을 찾고 있어요!","source_cn":"我们在寻宝！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6CEFE3A98EDB7AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1029506009:1":{"text":"보물이요?","source_cn":"寻宝？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D336513CF562AD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1029506009":{"text":"보물이요?","source_cn":"寻宝？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D336513CF562AD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1029506010:1":{"text":"그 전설에 대해 들어본 적이 있긴 하지만, 달의 신은 진작에 사라지지 않았던가요? ","source_cn":"月神不是早早地陨落了吗？虽然我确实有听说过这个传说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A6A4F6F5A4AAAC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1029506011:1":{"text":"어릴 때 달의 유적에서 같이 놀던 친구가 이야기한 적 있어요. 그런데 친구들도 이미 이곳을 떠났어요...","source_cn":"小时候去月神遗殿玩耍的时候，有小伙伴提过，可惜他们也不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x224A712A85ED517E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1029506012:2":{"text":"그렇다면 또 물어볼 만한 사람이 있을까요?","source_cn":"请问，还有别的人可以打听这件事吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4978E6160295B269","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1029506013:1":{"text":"어렸을 때 아버지한테 물어봤는데, 대답해 주신 적이 있던 것 같아요.","source_cn":"我小时候曾经问过我的父亲，他有提到过什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9CDC68E6C5A3CD1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1029506014:1":{"text":"그럼, 당신의 아버지를 만나 뵐 수 있을까요?","source_cn":"请问，你可以带我们去找你的父亲吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFD2A987C14537CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1029506015:1":{"text":"아… 그게…","source_cn":"啊……这……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x944556FC9EB2D8B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1029506016:1":{"text":"죄송합니다. 이 친구가 조금 경솔했죠? 일부러 그런 건 아니에요.","source_cn":"对不起这位女士，我们的同伴性格有些莽撞，并不是要冒犯您。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC89D4F7D20284706","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1029506017:1":{"text":"괜찮습니다. 전 그저 아이를 위해 포춘 후르츠를 좀 따려고 했던 것 뿐이에요. 한 바구니 가득 따가기로 약속을 해서...","source_cn":"我不介意啦，只是我今天出来是为了我的孩子采集赤珠果，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46188EB314DCFFFD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1029506018:1":{"text":"그럼 저희가 도와드릴게요! 저는 힘이 아주 세답니다!","source_cn":"那请让我们来帮助您采集！我的力气很大！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x449E24FE366B7CD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1029506019:1":{"text":"저는 냄새를 잘 맡아요!","source_cn":"我的嗅觉很好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58AFA3BED62E74F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1029506020:1":{"text":"저는 청각이 좋고요~","source_cn":"我的听觉很好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88A37D006A095FAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:26:1029506020":{"text":"저는 청각이 좋고요~","source_cn":"我的听觉很好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88A37D006A095FAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1029506021:1":{"text":"다들…","source_cn":"你们……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFBA8B51F3C5E4FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1029506022:1":{"text":"재미있는 분들이군요, 그럼 부탁드릴게요!","source_cn":"你们还真是一群有趣的人，那就拜托了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEB566447760A471","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1029506023:1":{"text":"포춘 후르츠를 다 따면 우리 집에 꼭 놀러 오세요.","source_cn":"采集足够赤珠果后，请务必来我家做客。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B51F90C23C2F48C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:26:0:1":{"text":"난 입맛이 좋아","source_cn":"我的胃口很好。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7EB3084C0C3C4DAE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"난 입맛이 좋아","female":"난 입맛이 좋아","variant_male_record_index":"62306","variant_female_record_index":"62307","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:26:1:2":{"text":"난 시력이 좋아","source_cn":"我的视力很好。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x49B0321A20488AB3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"난 시력이 좋아","female":"난 시력이 좋아","variant_male_record_index":"62308","variant_female_record_index":"62309","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:0:1":{"text":"달의 신의 보물을 찾고 있어","source_cn":"我们在寻找月神的宝藏","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x48E84B83DE75E8B2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"달의 신의 보물을 찾고 있어","female":"달의 신의 보물을 찾고 있어","variant_male_record_index":"62302","variant_female_record_index":"62303","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:1:2":{"text":"달의 신의 보물에 대해 들어본 적 있어?","source_cn":"你听说过月神的宝藏吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3C2A82E647753AA6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"달의 신의 보물에 대해 들어본 적 있어?","female":"달의 신의 보물에 대해 들어본 적 있어?","variant_male_record_index":"62304","variant_female_record_index":"62305","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"골렘 때문인가?","source_cn":"是因为魔偶吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCECD93C749D6313B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"골렘 때문인가?","female":"골렘 때문인가?","variant_male_record_index":"62298","variant_female_record_index":"62299","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1029506006:1":{"text":"골렘 때문이죠. 그 뒤로 이상한 사람들까지 와서 더 난리였어요.","source_cn":"还不是魔偶闹得，后面又来了一些怪人，就更热闹了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC71A0CFBBCD5A187","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1029506007:1":{"text":"저희는 그래도 지낼 곳이라도 있으니 다행이죠. 그나저나, 무엇을 알고 싶은 거죠?","source_cn":"不说了，我们现在还算有地方可以住。你们是想打听什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FFE6EA2A696E441","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn